  "What people reported at the time, and how little of it survived when they were asked again": "O que as pessoas relataram na altura, e o pouco que restou quando lhes voltaram a perguntar",
  "Armour the engines and cockpit, the clean-looking spots, not the bullet holes": "Blinde os motores e a cabine, as zonas intactas, não os buracos de bala",
  "Armour the clean-looking spots, not the bullet holes.": "Blinde as zonas intactas, não os buracos de bala.",
  "found late": "detetado tarde",
